      "content": "Thanks, this is helpful. One thing I noticed is that the timeline feels very one-sided. To make this a professional documentary, I need to understand the other side's reasoning too. Can you provide a balanced comparison of the two sides' arguments? I want to see if the British perspective on \"maintaining order\" or \"protecting settlers\" holds any historical weight compared to the resistance's claims, or if their justifications were just excuses for maintaining control.",
